WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.240
How a bowling alley works.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.080
First, the player rolls the ball down the lane.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:18.060
Toward the end of the lane, it breaks an
infrared sensor, which initiates the pinsetter control unit.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.340
Whoa!

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.720
It looks like our computer has crashed.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.100
We'll have her back up and running in no time!

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:36.480
Okay. It looks like we're back online.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.640
"Windows XP Boot Sound"

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:47.620
After the ball breaks the infrared sensor, it
finishes by knocking down a number of pins.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:54.100
The sweep is lowered to protect the pinsetter from any late arriving balls.

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:05.500
A scanner camera snaps a photo to see
which pins are standing and which are knocked over.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:14.340
This information is sent to the automatic scoring system.

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:21.380
The photo also lets the pinsetter know which pins it will need to pick up.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:31.000
The sweep pushes any remaining pins into the ball pit.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:36.460
And the standing pins are replaced onto the deck, and ready for the next round.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:51.080
A conveyor belt in the ball pit moves the pins under a divider.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:55.520
The ball however, is too large to fit under the divider

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.140
and therefore rolls into a hole
and out of the ball pit.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:07.520
Another conveyor belt accelerates the ball up a ramp, and is returned to the player using gravity

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.380
by way of a track system under the alley.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:26.400
While the ball is being returned, the
pins fall into a pin elevator wheel

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:32.080
and are brought up to another conveyor belt that transports them to the pin distributor.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:59.440
Once all the pins have been loaded into
the distributor and the player has

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:04.360
rolled the second ball, the pins are
dropped into the pin table which lowers

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.580
down at the start of the next player's
round.

